.TH CNFTCTL 1 "July 2026" "cnftctl" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
cnftctl \- guarded nftables host firewall manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cnftctl
.RI [ global-options ]
.I command
.RI [ command-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cnftctl
manages the application-owned
.B inet hostfw
nftables profile on Debian 13. Amd64 is production-supported; arm64 packages
are experimental, unvalidated on a disposable live host, and used at the
operator's own risk. Desired configuration is separate from immutable active
generations. Every live policy change arms a systemd-owned rollback and
requires explicit confirmation.
.SH SAFETY
Arrange tested console or rescue access before applying remote firewall
changes. The rollback timeout cannot be bypassed. Docker integration and
trusted interfaces are disabled by default.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/cnftctl/config.yaml
Mutable desired configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/cnftctl
Immutable generations, transaction audit state, and active selection.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/cnftctl/operator-guide.md
Complete operating instructions.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/cnftctl/commands.md
Command-by-command reference and examples.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/cnftctl/install.md
Verified package installation and first activation.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/cnftctl/uninstall.md
Guarded retirement and package removal.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nft (8),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR journalctl (1)
